  // Plan 00034 step 6: take, leave, drop and defer, the stores they write to, and the identity they key
  // on. Every test in the three files is held to it: a full run fails while any is killed by none.
  //
  //   dotnet run scripts/mutate-behaviour.cs -- --set tests/AgentBaseline.Tests/Mutations/section-decisions.json
  //
  // Two mutations were considered and left out as EQUIVALENT, each read before it was dropped:
  // writing a take as `left.Text = …` is one Replace over the whole document in AvaloniaEdit, so the
  // text and the single step of undo come out the same; and walking a sibling search past the parent
  // changes nothing, because no section before its parent can share that parent.
